//! The `ruby-overhang` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property specifies
//! whether or not a `ruby` annotation overhangs any surrounding text.
//!
//! Initial: auto. Inherited: yes.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Keyword effects:
//! - auto: When a ruby annotation container is longer than its corresponding base container, the
//! annotation may partially overlap adjacent text. Whether, and how much to overhang are determined
//! by the user agent.
